<title>USA: FDA panel recommends Genentech Nutropin.</title>
<headline>FDA panel recommends Genentech Nutropin.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTH SAN FRANCISCO 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Genentech Inc said a Food and Drug Administration advisory committee recommended its Nutropin growth hormone for marketing clearance as a treatment for growth failure associated with Turner Syndrome.</p>
<p>Turner Syndrome is a chromosomal disorder affecting about one in 2,500 female, live births. It is characterized by short stature and ovarian dysfunction.</p>
</text>
